{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1248341,\"title\":\"Maria Bonita\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Maria Bonita is a girl who, because of her beauty, draws the attention of many suitors. Although João Canoeiro likes Maria Bonita, the girl falls in love with Luiz.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nCzIjg2cQaY3HDTRdtw7yy2Yuyk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1937,\"runtime\":75,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"BR\",\"name\":\"Brazil\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Julien Mandel\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4550255,\"name\":\"Julien Mandel\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6w7UP9ldbS6qxJtwPuLvZl89mB0.jpg\"},{\"id\":4550269,\"name\":\"Eliane Angel\",\"character\":\"Maria Bonita\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o971HQi7LHHr9vidFBmQMVLN0Lm.jpg\"},{\"id\":5594238,\"name\":\"Victor Macedo\",\"character\":\"João Carneiro\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1602299,\"name\":\"Marília Batista\",\"character\":\"Pequenina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jmS1A7Y6dp4itwFSW6DclMuE80e.jpg\"},{\"id\":5663687,\"name\":\"Plinio Monteiro\",\"character\":\"Dr. Luis\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1174936,\"name\":\"José Carlos Burle\",\"character\":\"Promotor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8XOQNadijFqVK8O94AvcMzzskfK.jpg\"},{\"id\":5663695,\"name\":\"Henrique Batista\",\"character\":\"Chico Xavier\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5663697,\"name\":\"Lila Oliva\",\"character\":\"D. Mariana\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5663699,\"name\":\"Mariazinha Olive\",\"character\":\"Andrezinho\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5663702,\"name\":\"Sérgio Schnoor\",\"character\":\"Lucas\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1546462,\"name\":\"Lourdinha Bittencourt\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1311317,\"name\":\"Manuel F. Araujo\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kFt03b2vMjYTWajEmzkCSXFJJzL.jpg\"},{\"id\":4550271,\"name\":\"Augusto Calheiros\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cTCLnDpAeX5vLsBkFmK89BECnSt.jpg\"},{\"id\":5663705,\"name\":\"Hendy Lehmayer\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":83533,\"title\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bRBeSHfGHwkEpImlhxPmOcUsaeg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u8DU5fkLoM5tTRukzPC31oGPxaQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the wake of the devastating war against the RDA and the loss of their eldest son, Jake Sully and Neytiri face a new threat on Pandora: the Ash People, a violent and power-hungry Na'vi tribe led by the ruthless Varang. Jake's family must fight for their survival and the future of Pandora in a conflict that pushes them to their emotional and physical limits.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":569094,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Across the Spider-Verse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Vt6mWEReuy4Of61Lnj5Xj704m8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kVd3a9YeLGkoeR50jGEXM6EqseS.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After reuniting with Gwen Stacy, Brooklyn’s full-time, friendly neighborhood Spider-Man is catapulted across the Multiverse, where he encounters the Spider Society, a team of Spider-People charged with protecting the Multiverse's very existence. But when the heroes clash on how to handle a new threat, Miles finds himself pitted against the other Spiders and must set out on his own to save those he loves most.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":150540,\"title\":\"Inside Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jJKZaTBNenlFclQyjrnvzkRmvWE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1234821,\"title\":\"Jurassic World Rebirth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1RICxzeoNCAO5NpcRMIgg1XT6fm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zNriRTr0kWwyaXPzdg1EIxf0BWk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Five years after the events of Jurassic World Dominion, covert operations expert Zora Bennett is contracted to lead a skilled team on a top-secret mission to secure genetic material from the world's three most massive dinosaurs. When Zora's operation intersects with a civilian family whose boating expedition was capsized, they all find themselves stranded on an island where they come face-to-face with a sinister, shocking discovery that's been hidden from the world for decades.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":370172,\"title\":\"No Time to Die\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iUgygt3fscRoKWCV1d0C7FbM9TP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x9td0NQha0t44K2qgcMipLOGjVi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bond has left active service and is enjoying a tranquil life in Jamaica. His peace is short-lived when his old friend Felix Leiter from the CIA turns up asking for help. The mission to rescue a kidnapped scientist turns out to be far more treacherous than expected, leading Bond onto the trail of a mysterious villain armed with dangerous new technology.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":545611,\"title\":\"Everything Everywhere All at Once\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u68AjlvlutfEIcpmbYpKcdi09ut.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fIwiFha3WPu5nHkBeMQ4GzEk0Hv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An aging Chinese immigrant is swept up in an insane adventure, where she alone can save what's important to her by connecting with the lives she could have led in other universes.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420818,\"title\":\"The Lion King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dzBtMocZuJbjLOXvrl4zGYigDzh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TUg5pO1VZ4B0Q1amk3OlXvlpXV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub's arrival. Scar, Mufasa's brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba's exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":640146,\"title\":\"Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qnqGbB22YJ7dSs4o6M7exTpNxPz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m8JTwHFwX7I7JY5fPe4SjqejWag.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Super-Hero partners Scott Lang and Hope van Dyne, along with with Hope's parents Janet van Dyne and Hank Pym, and Scott's daughter Cassie Lang, find themselves exploring the Quantum Realm, interacting with strange new creatures and embarking on an adventure that will push them beyond the limits of what they thought possible.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":260513,\"title\":\"Incredibles 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9lFKBtaVIhP7E2Pk0IY1CwTKTMZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mabuNsGJgRuCTuGqjFkWe1xdu19.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Elastigirl springs into action to save the day, while Mr. Incredible faces his greatest challenge yet – taking care of the problems of his three children.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420817,\"title\":\"Aladdin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ykUEbfpkf8d0w49pHh0AD2KrT52.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rVqY0Bo4Npf6EIONUROxjYAJfmD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A kindhearted street urchin named Aladdin embarks on a magical adventure after finding a lamp that releases a wisecracking genie while a power-hungry Grand Vizier vies for the same lamp that has the power to make their deepest wishes come true.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":49519,\"title\":\"The Croods\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/27zvjVOtOi5ped1HSlJKNsKXkFH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wFN8llYh215M8i2fqWAcPV8CSyL.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The prehistoric Croods family live in a particularly dangerous moment in time. Patriarch Grug, his mate Ugga, teenage daughter Eep, son Thunk, and feisty Gran gather food by day and huddle together in a cave at night. When a more evolved caveman named Guy arrives on the scene, Grug is distrustful, but it soon becomes apparent that Guy is correct about the impending destruction of their world.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":257445,\"title\":\"Goosebumps\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aeZT9pqEgrmXOGdESFkAuVjX6kw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6mPe4rBHzDMal2oL6hVgOBkaHz9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After moving to a small town, Zach Cooper finds a silver lining when he meets next door neighbor Hannah, the daughter of bestselling Goosebumps series author R.L. Stine. When Zach unintentionally unleashes real monsters from their manuscripts and they begin to terrorize the town, it’s suddenly up to Stine, Zach and Hannah to get all of them back in the books where they belong.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"f6W-CwXpxxA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"IcGMncYsXhE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"OIP0qWSYZ9Y\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}